  "title": "Pozole Rojo (Mexican Pork and Hominy Stew)",
  "description": "This pozole recipe is a tasty traditional Mexican pork soup with hominy cooked in a rich and smoky red sauce made with guajillo chiles and tomatoes.",
  "authors": [
    "Consuelo Aguilar"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-04T00:07:58-04:00",
